WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.468
Did you stay up late to study?
That's so unlike you.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.345
I was thinking about my life.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:14.222
-Morning!
-Hey.

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:15.849
-Morning.
-Hey.

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:19.978
-Morning.
-Morning!

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:21.813
-Morning.
-Morning!

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:25.692
What is it?

00:00:31.948 --> 00:00:33.658
What's going on?

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.077
-Hinode?
-What is it?

00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:39.372
This is for you!

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:40.415
-What?
-What?

00:00:41.332 --> 00:00:42.208
TO KENTO HINODE

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:47.088
Is that a letter I see, Miss Muge?

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:48.840
It's none of your business!

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:53.386
Is it a love letter?

00:00:53.511 --> 00:00:54.929
-Give it back!
-Niibori!

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:55.847
-Got it!
-Muge!

00:00:56.347 --> 00:00:59.350
Miss Muge, Miss Muge! Over here!

00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:03.021
-Confession time!
-Knock it off!

00:01:03.521 --> 00:01:05.690
How about I read it out loud?

00:01:06.691 --> 00:01:09.069
Ta-da!

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:13.448
-Cut it out, you two!
-Are you really going to read it, Bannai?

00:01:14.532 --> 00:01:16.785
She went all out! How pathetic can you be?

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:22.624
"To Hinode.
I feel happy whenever I see you."

00:01:22.707 --> 00:01:27.295
-Bannai!
-"Hinode Sunrise isn't just a pun."

00:01:27.378 --> 00:01:28.588
Give it back!

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:33.384
"It's how I feel about you.
You're my sunrise."

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:36.221
-The letter isn't for you!
-Give it back!

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:37.806
-Give it back!
-"Hinode Sunrise is

00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:40.225
when the sun rises above the horizon

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.560
-and warms my soul."
-Stop it!

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:43.770
Give it back!

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.314
Why are you so desperate?

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:49.818
Is this too embarrassing for you?

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:55.156
Why should I be embarrassed?
Don't make fun of my feelings!

00:01:57.408 --> 00:02:01.621
Are you going to accept
her love confession?

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:04.833
Mr. Sunrise?

00:02:07.585 --> 00:02:08.461
Hinode...

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:16.427
What?

00:02:18.346 --> 00:02:19.264
Why?

00:02:21.266 --> 00:02:23.601
Confession time! Confession!

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:24.602
Shut up!

00:02:25.436 --> 00:02:30.275
I just wanted you to cheer up.

00:02:30.358 --> 00:02:34.195
I'm just like you.
I can't say the things I truly feel.

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:37.949
-So--
-I'm not like you!

00:02:39.951 --> 00:02:41.452
This is embarrassing for me.

00:02:42.287 --> 00:02:45.790
Have you considered my feelings?
He read it in front of everyone.

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:49.627
I hate pushy people like you.

00:02:50.962 --> 00:02:53.298
But... what if I told you
in person instead--

00:02:53.381 --> 00:02:57.135
Just leave me alone!
Didn't you hear me? I hate you!

00:02:58.303 --> 00:03:00.305
You hate me?

00:03:02.056 --> 00:03:03.183
I really hate you.

00:03:06.102 --> 00:03:08.813
I see.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.653
You hate me that much, huh?

00:03:16.738 --> 00:03:17.655
Muge?

00:03:19.657 --> 00:03:21.659
That's too bad.

00:03:23.995 --> 00:03:25.079
Muge!

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:27.248
Die!

